{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen Garden (\u5929\u9009\u82b1\u56ed / \u5929\u9078\u82b1\u5712 ) is a cozy roguelike deck-builder with a gardening twist! Cultivate unique garden and aim for victory before your harvests run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With endless combinations, no two runs are ever the same! Place over 100 plants, adapt to shifting weather, and bloom your strategy across diverse garden layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/9f735f8e5bd8d83bc4e4fa4df17ce498.poster.avif?t=1759490089\" width=888 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/9f735f8e5bd8d83bc4e4fa4df17ce498.webm?t=1759490089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/9f735f8e5bd8d83bc4e4fa4df17ce498.mp4?t=1759490089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand, Harvest, and Replant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a 3\u00d73 plot and expand your garden tile by tile. Harvest and replant strategically to maximize your yield and maintain the powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/331e49701e944a83b0e9e884910561f3.poster.avif?t=1759490089\" width=888 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/331e49701e944a83b0e9e884910561f3.webm?t=1759490089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/331e49701e944a83b0e9e884910561f3.mp4?t=1759490089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the Ultimate Garden Build</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique plants with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 upgrade paths to specialize plant traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 fertilizers to boost growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 animals with bonus powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 weather effects offering buffs and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 tools for run-wide bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct gardens,  with unique tiles and special plants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/1b7f8ff55125613c48aedbc82957f31c.avif?t=1759490089\" width=600 height=456 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Gardening Adventure for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to  tunes, charming hand-drawn visuals, and smooth animations as you cultivate your dream garden. Watch your creation thrive, or refine your strategy for the perfect run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/7dbca83a84471cb791e7747bcf2bc0f1.avif?t=1759490089\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923750?t=1759490089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/5a18a66477af5b7880c299b74534801477f43f74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759490089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite